 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "As-Sa'di has no entry for 107 and 109: Al-Muyassar only. The gloss on 109:25-27 (fighting) is left out. STAGING v4: 107: the dominion of the heavens and the earth as a geometric plate with a camera tilt to sky and ground. 108: people asking (Al-Muyassar: أيها الناس) and turning on «الكفر»; Musa and the Messenger are not drawn. 109: many of the People of the Book wish to turn the believers back (point); «حتى يأتي الله بأمره» (fighting, per Al-Muyassar) is not pictured. 110: the believers pray, then give the zakah to a poor man who raises his hands; seal plate over the Names. STAGING v4: 107: the dominion of the heavens and the earth as a geometric plate with a camera tilt to sky and ground. 108: people asking (Al-Muyassar: أيها الناس) and turning on «الكفر»; Musa and the Messenger are not drawn. 109: many of the People of the Book wish to turn the believers back (point); «حتى يأتي الله بأمره» (fighting, per Al-Muyassar) is not pictured. 110: the believers pray, then give the zakah to a poor man who raises his hands; seal plate over the Names. STAGING v4: 107: the dominion of the heavens and the earth as a geometric plate with a camera tilt to sky and ground. 108: people asking (Al-Muyassar: أيها الناس) and turning on «الكفر»; Musa and the Messenger are not drawn. 109: many of the People of the Book wish to turn the believers back (point); «حتى يأتي الله بأمره» (fighting, per Al-Muyassar) is not pictured. 110: the believers pray, then give the zakah to a poor man who raises his hands; seal plate over the Names."
